sh\" \"$plan_dir\" US-01 \"Keyboard/mouse user opening the local HTML file\" \"Open button-chain.html, click the current last button four times, always choosing the bottom-most visible button\" \"Mouse click on the visible current last button for each chain step\" \"After the fourth generated button is clicked, the page contains only lowercase finished with a visible white border\" W01,W02,W03,W04,W06\n\"$PLANNING_SKILL_DIR/scripts/configure-ui-story-cache.sh\" \"$plan_dir\" US-01 \"Fresh local button-chain.html loaded in a browser with one visible initial button\" \"Click the bottom-most visible button; repeat until the fourth generated button has been activated\" \"Current last button / completion result\" \"A new lower button appears after each of the first four qualifying clicks, then only finished remains with a visible white border\" \"2 seconds per click/result transition\"\n\"$PLANNING_SKILL_DIR/scripts/update-plan-content.sh\" --testing-requirement \"$plan_dir\" 01-button-chain-html yes \"The HTML behavior is user-visible and must be proven by downstream DOM and browser-story verification work units W05 and W06.\"\n\"$PLANNING_SKILL_DIR/scripts/update-plan-content.sh\" --testing-requirement \"$plan_dir\" 02-proof-and-handoff yes \"This goal owns the planned automated and browser proof work units W05 and W06.\"\n\"$PLANNING_SKILL_DIR/scripts/create-step-testing.sh\" \"$plan_dir/01-button-chain-html\" 01-step-initial-markup \"Automated DOM test W05 must load button-chain.html and assert exactly one button exists before any click, no finished text is present, and the button is visible. Browser story W06 must confirm the same load state before clicking.\"\n\"$PLANNING_SKILL_DIR/scripts/create-step-testing.sh\" \"$plan_dir/01-button-chain-html\" 02-step-button-layout-style \"Automated DOM test W05 must assert appended buttons are in document order below the previous button. Browser story W06 must visually confirm each new button appears below the last clicked control.\"\n\"$PLANNING_SKILL_DIR/scripts/create-step-testing.sh\" \"$plan_dir/01-button-chain-html\" 03-step-append-handler \"Automated DOM test W05 must click only the current last button and assert each click appends exactly one button; clicking a non-last prior button must not append. Browser story W06 must use normal mouse clicks on the bottom-most button.\"\n\"$PLANNING_SKILL_DIR/scripts/create-step-testing.sh\" \"$plan_dir/01-button-chain-html\" 04-step-finish-handler \"Automated DOM test W05 and Browser story W06 must activate the fourth generated button and assert the document is cleared before rendering exactly finished with a visible white border.\"\n\"$PLANNING_SKILL_DIR/scripts/create-step-testing.sh\" \"$plan_dir/02-proof-and-handoff\" 01-step-dom-test \"Run the future repository-appropriate DOM test command, record command, exit code, and assertions covering W01-W04; the test must fail if text is not exactly lowercase finished or the white border is absent.\"\n\"$PLANNING_SKILL_DIR/scripts/create-step-testing.sh\" \"$plan_dir/02-proof-and-handoff\" 02-step-browser-story \"Run US-01 through real browser input only: load the local HTML file, click the current last visible button through the fourth generated button, capture final visible result, and record pass/fail evidence in ui-story-runs/US-01.md.\"\n\"$PLANNING_SKILL_DIR/scripts/create-adversarial-review.sh\" \"$plan_dir\"\n\"$PLANNING_SKILL_DIR/scripts/create-plan-progress.sh\" \"$plan_dir\"\n\"$PLANNING_SKILL_DIR/scripts/create-progress.sh\" \"$plan_dir/01-button-chain-html\" 01-button-chain-html\n\"$PLANNING_SKILL_DIR/scripts/create-progress.sh\" \"$plan_dir/02-proof-and-handoff\" 02-proof-and-handoff\n'","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
